{
  "title": "Iterating Through Collections Directly",
  "subtitle": "Processing Items One by One",
  "topic": "5.1 • ITERATING COLLECTIONS",
  "body": "<div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 18px; width: 100%;\">\n  <div style=\"text-align: center; margin-bottom: 4px; width: 100%;\">\n    <div style=\"display: inline-block; background-color: #ffffff; border: 3px solid #111111; box-shadow: 4px 4px 0px #111111; padding: 4px 14px; margin-bottom: 10px; font-weight: 900; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 1px;\">\n      5.1 • Collection Traversal\n    </div>\n    <h1 style=\"font-family: 'Title', 'Body', sans-serif; font-size: 30px; font-weight: 900; color: #111111; margin: 0 0 8px 0; text-transform: uppercase;\">\n      Direct <hlt>List Traversal</hlt>\n    </h1>\n    <p style=\"font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; color: #222222; margin: 0 auto; max-width: 640px;\">\n      Python allows you to loop over items directly without messing with index counters!\n    </p>\n  </div>\n\n  <div style=\"background: #a7f3d0; border: 3px solid #111111; box-shadow: 6px 6px 0px #111111; border-radius: 4px; padding: 20px;\">\n    <span style=\"display: inline-block; background-color: #ffffff; color: #111111; border: 2px solid #111111; box-shadow: 2px 2px 0px #111111; padding: 2px 8px; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 900; text-transform: uppercase; margin-bottom: 8px;\">\n      Real-World Example: Music Playlist\n    </span>\n    <h2 style=\"font-family: 'Title', 'Body', sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 900; color: #111111; margin: 0 0 10px 0; text-transform: uppercase;\">\n      Playing Every Track Sequentially\n    </h2>\n    <p style=\"font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600; color: #111111; margin: 0 0 12px 0; line-height: 1.5;\">\n      In Python, writing <hlt>for song in playlist:</hlt> automatically hands you each song item one by one from start to finish:\n    </p>\n    <div style=\"background: #0d1117; border: 2px solid #111111; box-shadow: 3px 3px 0 #111111; padding: 14px; font-family: 'Consolas', monospace; color: #f0f6fc; font-size: 14px; border-radius: 4px;\">\n      playlist = [<span style=\"color: #a5d6ff;\">\"Midnight Jazz\"</span>, <span style=\"color: #a5d6ff;\">\"Ocean Waves\"</span>, <span style=\"color: #a5d6ff;\">\"City Lights\"</span>]<br/><br/>\n      <span style=\"color: #ff7b72;\">for</span> track <span style=\"color: #ff7b72;\">in</span> playlist:<br/>\n      &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"color: #79c0ff;\">print</span>(<span style=\"color: #a5d6ff;\">\"Now Playing:\"</span>, track)<br/>\n      <span style=\"color: #8b949e;\"># Outputs:<br/># Now Playing: Midnight Jazz<br/># Now Playing: Ocean Waves<br/># Now Playing: City Lights</span>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>"
}